{"version":1,"content":"<p>在中國武漢舉行的DTC 2026大會上，TCL華星光電行政總裁趙軍確認，LG旗下UltraGear 25G590B顯示器所採用的1000Hz面板來自TCL華星。該面板為24.5英寸、全高清解像度，並採用IPS液晶技術。據稱，這是TCL華星首次實現1000Hz液晶面板的量產。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587354.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:43:53.063335+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:26:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_hash":"cc0400bf83ac77bb5c8459532e1edf190af9336f818b19a5d49603633fe64ec4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}